WEBVTT

00:00:00.231 --> 00:00:04.895
The Park Pass 2027 guide
Everything you need to know, step by step

00:00:04.945 --> 00:00:08.815
Open the Park Pass
Scan the code on any Park Pass poster, or visit the link on our website.

00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:13.011
Add it to your home screen
Open the Park Pass, then tap the Share button ⬆. In Safari it may be under ⋯.

00:00:13.061 --> 00:00:16.212
Add it to your home screen
Swipe the menu up, or tap View More.

00:00:16.262 --> 00:00:19.542
Add it to your home screen
Tap Add to Home Screen.

00:00:19.592 --> 00:00:25.487
Important: turn OFF “Open as Web App”
If it’s on, the icon opens a separate copy of the Park Pass with none of your stamps.

00:00:25.537 --> 00:00:29.205
Then tap Add
Leave “Open as Web App” switched off (gray).

00:00:29.255 --> 00:00:32.539
Your Park Pass icon!
It’s on your home screen, one tap away.

00:00:32.589 --> 00:00:37.494
All your stamps are there
It opens in your browser, where your progress is saved. Use the same browser every time.

00:00:37.544 --> 00:00:41.063
Add it to your home screen
In Chrome, tap the three dots ⋮ at the top right.

00:00:41.113 --> 00:00:44.060
Add it to your home screen
Tap Add to Home screen (or Install app).

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.206
Add it to your home screen
Tap Add (or Install).

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:50.521
Your Park Pass icon!
Tap it any time to open your Park Pass.

00:00:50.571 --> 00:01:00.554
Keep your stamps safe 💾
Your progress is saved on your phone, in your browser.

00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:07.561
Make your explorer
Type your child’s first name and pick a park buddy.

00:01:07.611 --> 00:01:10.499
Three ways to play
📷 Go to events · ⭐ Do a challenge each month · 🔒 Find 7 hidden lockboxes

00:01:10.549 --> 00:01:15.180
Each one has its own tab
Events, Challenges and Lockboxes are on the bar at the bottom.

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.131
Everything grows your flower 🌸
Each activity fills a petal of your WELL flower.

00:01:18.181 --> 00:01:28.367
February to November
Something new every month. Here’s the 2027 season.

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:39.090
Summer into fall
More events, a new challenge each month, and the big finale.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:50.925
A little at a time
So there’s always something to look forward to.

00:01:50.975 --> 00:02:01.050
Every event is in the app
Tap Events, then Calendar. Add the whole season to your phone’s calendar.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:13.929
Get an event stamp
Step by step:

00:02:13.979 --> 00:02:26.810
Finish a challenge
Step by step:

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:39.698
Open a lockbox
Step by step:

00:02:39.748 --> 00:02:52.567
Do the mystery challenge
A surprise inside every lockbox:

00:02:52.617 --> 00:03:08.096
Point totals
5 points fills a petal. Fill all 6 petals to bloom!

00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:14.251
Scan at events
Point your phone’s camera at the poster code at any Park Pass event.

00:03:14.301 --> 00:03:20.576
You’re checked in!
You get the event stamp and a secret combo for one of the lockboxes.

00:03:20.626 --> 00:03:26.409
Heading to a lockbox?
The Lockboxes tab shows what else you can do on the same trip, and what to pack.

00:03:26.459 --> 00:03:32.249
Find the lockbox
Pick the box on the map, then tap Directions.

00:03:32.299 --> 00:03:38.574
Open it with your combo
Inside: a rubber stamp, a secret word card and a mystery challenge!

00:03:38.624 --> 00:03:45.331
Type the secret word
Your lockbox stamp lands in your pass. +2 points!

00:03:45.381 --> 00:03:52.448
Don’t leave yet! 🌳
Do the mystery card and any park challenge while you’re at the park.

00:03:52.498 --> 00:04:03.183
Do it, flip the card, type the word
Every lockbox has one. +2 points!

00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:11.494
Monthly challenges
Tap Challenges. A new one opens every month, each with a step-by-step guide.

00:04:11.544 --> 00:04:25.598
Finish it for a secret word
Tap the round Unlock button and type the word in. +1 point!

00:04:25.648 --> 00:04:41.130
Visit our staff 🤝
Share your finished challenge with us for an extra point.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:45.347
Watch your flower grow
Events, challenges and lockboxes all fill your petals.

00:04:45.397 --> 00:04:55.721
Collect your stamps
Each tab keeps its own stamps: challenges, lockboxes and events.

00:04:55.771 --> 00:05:03.107
Tap ❓ Help anytime
Step-by-step guides, common questions and bigger text. Or ask any of our staff!

00:05:03.157 --> 00:05:15.233
Let’s grow together!
Scan the code to start your Park Pass: ellemichellestrother-cmyk.github.io/basehor-wellness-pass
